biquad explicit-coefficient filter (src/audio/biquad.ts, src/audio/biquad-kernels.ts)

src/audio/biquad.ts and src/audio/biquad-kernels.ts adapt FFmpeg
libavfilter/af_biquads.c for the biquad filter type: the biquad_options table
(a0..b2 in the INT32 range, mix, channels, normalize, transform, precision,
blocksize, with their shorthand order), query_formats() (s16p, s32p, fltp,
dblp for precision auto, otherwise the one pinned planar format),
config_filter()'s coefficient preparation (division by a0, the normalize
factor when |b0 + b1 + b2| > 1e-6, convert_dir2latt, convert_dir2svf,
convert_dir2zdf reading the raw oa/ob values, and the copy to a_float/b_float),
and the BIQUAD_DII, BIQUAD_TDI, BIQUAD_TDII, BIQUAD_LATT, BIQUAD_SVF and
BIQUAD_ZDF kernels (float for s16p and fltp, double for s32p and dblp, mix and
dry in the kernel type, integer clipping with truncation, and the per-channel
4-value cache carried across frames as filter_channel() does without
blocksize).

